id: pm-2xtv84
title: "GH-1201: Recover invalid pending receipt evidence across release upgrades"
description: "Investigate the reported 2026.9.4 writer to 2026.9.5 reader failure and health/reconcile recovery loop. Source inspection confirms collections is a diagnostic category, not a required top-level key: it validates fields_from_theirs, union_fields, decisions and optional merged_field_hashes. Pending and reconciled receipts share this validation before state filtering. The underlying malformed field requires a privacy-safe reproduction; absence of a collections key alone is not evidence of schema incompatibility."
