    text: "Integrated verification 2026-09-06: full source coverage is exact 100/100/100/100: statements 62641/62641, branches 47517/47517, functions 12984/12984, lines 60208/60208. The 8475-test coverage run passed 8474 tests and identified one repository directory-load failure (121 files over the 120-file SDK test folder ceiling). Moving the new receipt-schema suite into tests/unit/sdk/merge restored the limit; the focused 30-test structural/schema/review run passed. All eight active item linked-test runs passed through pm test, preserving execution receipts. Temporary installed npm and Bun consumers passed warning-close, executable evidence update, and immutable-history verification. Packed npx and bunx smoke passed across 13 packages. TypeScript and ESLint passed. Credential scan and npm advisory census found zero secrets/vulnerabilities. Hosted checks, AI review, merge and published release verification are still pending and are separate from this local evidence."
  - created_at: "2026-09-06T05:44:31.418Z"
