    text: "Final local gates passed: repository static assurance with 100% governed docstring coverage, zero duplicate code, SDK and CLI contracts, context/token ceilings, graph composition, record integrity, package artifact, package-first dogfood, docs/skills and version policy. Exact source coverage and focused directory correction are recorded in the preceding evidence comment. No coverage threshold, source exclusion or quality budget was weakened. Hosted review, merge and release remain separate pending verification."
