learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-06T05:28:54.883Z","harness:codex",Missing-value encoding belongs at the receipt persistence boundary as well as the merge algorithm. Structured cloning preserves undefined properties in memory but JSON silently removes them; prior clone-local writer normalization must identify its encoding and must never invent missing retained or discarded evidence.
